message.content:
I used the **One-Pager Specification** template with the **Default** firm palette (Navy and Slate). This structure isolates the advisory actions into a linear checklist for the event coordinator.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Workshop Action Checklist</title>
    <style>
        /* Default Palette & System Settings */
        :root {
            --color-primary: #1a365d; /* Navy Blue */
            --color-secondary: #2d3748; /* Slate Gray */
            --color-accent: #3182ce; /* Lighter Blue */
            --color-bg: #f7fafc; /* Light Gray Background */
            --color-surface: #ffffff; /* White Surface */
            --color-text: #4a5568; /* Dark Gray Text */
            --font-main: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            background-color: #e2e8f0;
            color: var(--color-text);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .document {
            background-color: var(--color-surface);
            width: 210mm; /* A4 Width */
            min-height: 297mm; /* A4 Height */
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            box-sizing: border-box;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--color-primary);
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--color-secondary);
        }

        .meta span {
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .checklist-container {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .checklist {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .checklist-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding: 16px;
            background-color: var(--color-bg);
            border-radius: 4px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
        }

        .checklist-item:hover {
            background-color: #edf2f7;
        }

        .checkbox {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border: 2px solid var(--color-secondary);
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-right: 16px;
            margin-top: 4px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .checklist-item.completed .checkbox {
            background-color: var(--color-primary);
            border-color: var(--color-primary);
        }

        .checklist-item.completed .checkbox::after {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            left: 3px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .item-content {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .item-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .item-detail {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--color-text);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .section-divider {
            margin: 40px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="document">
        <header>
            <h1>Workshop Action Checklist</h1>
            <div class="meta">
                <span>Owner: Event Coordinator</span>
                <span>Purpose: Concise Action Items</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="checklist-container">
            <ul class="checklist">
                <!-- Item 1 -->
                <li class="checklist-item">
                    <div class="checkbox"></div>
                    <div class="item-content">
                        <div class="item-title">Confirm Venue Access</div>
                        <div class="item-detail">Verify physical entry permissions and technical access to the workshop location.</div>
                    </div>
                </li>

                <!-- Item 2 -->
                <li class="checklist-item">
                    <div class="checkbox"></div>
                    <div class="item-content">
                        <div class="item-title">Caption the Slides</div>
                        <div class="item-detail">Ensure all presentation materials have proper captions for accessibility requirements.</div>
                    </div>
                </li>

                <!-- Item 3 -->
                <li class="checklist-item">
                    <div class="checkbox"></div>
                    <div class="item-content">
                        <div class="item-title">Send Joining Details</div>
                        <div class="item-detail">Distribute login links or instructions to attendees exactly three days prior to the event.</div>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </main>

        <div class="section-divider">
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-secondary); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold;">Status</p>
            <p style="font-size: 14px;">Pending Execution</p>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Generated for Workshop Planning<br>
            LegalDesign System v4.0
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
